Package: jasprpc
Title: R Client for the JASP JSON-RPC API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("JASP", "Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "info@jasp-stats.org")
    )
Description: An R client for communicating with a running JASP desktop
    instance via its JSON-RPC 2.0 HTTP API.  Provides functions to create and
    run statistical analyses, load and inspect datasets, list available modules
    and analyses, and compose results.  All 13 RPC methods from the JASP
    OpenRPC specification are exposed as idiomatic R functions.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.0
Imports:
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    rlang
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
